async function session(type:'EMPLOYEE'|'CUSTOMER',id:string):Promise<CustomerContext>{const r=type==='CUSTOMER'?await db.customer.findUniqueOrThrow({where:{id}}):await db.employee.findUniqueOrThrow({where:{id}});const token=await db.$transaction(tx=>app.get(AuthSessionService).createAfterPasswordVerified(tx,{subjectType:type,subjectId:id,expectedPasswordHash:r.passwordHash,expectedTokenVersion:r.tokenVersion}));return {actor:await app.get(CurrentIdentityService).authenticate(db,token.accessToken,type),token:token.accessToken,requestId:randomUUID()};}
async function employee(role:'SUPER_ADMIN'|'MERCH_WAREHOUSE'|'CUSTOMER_SERVICE'){const e=await db.employee.create({data:{username:'m10_'+randomUUID().replaceAll('-','').slice(0,20),displayName:'隔离员工',role,passwordHash:hash,mustChangePassword:false}});return session('EMPLOYEE',e.id);}
async function customer(){const c=await db.customer.create({data:{phone:'139'+String(randomInt(100000000)).padStart(8,'0'),nickname:'隔离顾客',passwordHash:hash}});return session('CUSTOMER',c.id);}
async function settings(extra:Partial<typeof setting>={}){const service=app.get(StoreSettingsService);const current=await service.current();return service.update(admin.actor,admin.token,{...setting,...extra,expectedVersion:current.version,reason:'本轮独占测试设置'},randomUUID());}
async function paid(){const c=await customer(),p=await db.product.create({data:{productCode:'M10-'+randomUUID(),name:'隔离服装',status:'ON_SALE',createdById:admin.actor.subjectId,updatedById:admin.actor.subjectId}}),sku=await db.sku.create({data:{code:('M10-'+randomUUID()).toUpperCase(),productId:p.id,combinationSignature:'DEFAULT',priceCents:9900,costCents:4000,balance:{create:{available:10}}}}),a=await app.get(AddressService).create(c,address),cart=await app.get(CartService).add(c,{skuId:sku.id,quantity:2});const input={addressId:a.address.id,items:[{cartItemId:cart.item.id,skuId:sku.id,quantity:2}]},quote=await orders.preview(c,input),order=await orders.create(c,{...input,quoteId:quote.quoteId},randomUUID());await app.get(OrderCommands).pay(c,order.orderId);return {id:order.orderId,c,sku};}
async function claim(id:string,stage:TaskStage='SHIPMENT_PROCESS',actor=warehouse){const t=await db.task.findFirstOrThrow({where:{businessType:'ORDER',businessId:id,stage,status:{in:['OPEN','CLAIMED']}}});if(t.status==='OPEN')await app.get(TaskCommandService).claim(actor.actor,actor.token,t.id,{expectedVersion:t.version},randomUUID());return db.task.findUniqueOrThrow({where:{id:t.id}});}
async function body(id:string,stage:TaskStage='SHIPMENT_PROCESS'){const o=await db.order.findUniqueOrThrow({where:{id}}),t=await db.task.findFirst({where:{businessType:'ORDER',businessId:id,stage,status:{in:['OPEN','CLAIMED','SUSPENDED']}},orderBy:{round:'desc'}});return {commandKey:randomUUID(),expectedOrderVersion:o.version,expectedTaskVersion:t?.version??0,reason:'本轮实际核对'};}
async function packing(id:string){const o=await db.order.findUniqueOrThrow({where:{id}}),items=await db.orderItem.findMany({where:{orderId:id}});return {...await body(id),items:items.map(i=>({orderItemId:i.id,checkedQuantity:i.quantity})),goodsLocation:'独占货架A',expectedPhysicalVersion:o.stockPhysicalVersion};}
async function ready(){const f=await paid();await claim(f.id);await fulfillment.pack(warehouse,f.id,await packing(f.id));await fulfillment.prepare(warehouse,f.id,{...await body(f.id),carrierName:'测试承运人',trackingNumber:'M10-'+randomUUID()});return f;}
async function start(id:string){const q=await app.get(FulfillmentQueries).detail(warehouse,id);return fulfillment.start(warehouse,id,{...await body(id),shipmentId:q.shipment!.id,packingCheckId:q.packingCheck!.id,expectedPhysicalVersion:q.physicalVersion});}
async function shipped(){const f=await ready(),a=await start(f.id);await fulfillment.confirm(warehouse,f.id,{...await body(f.id),attemptId:a.attemptId!,expectedAttemptVersion:a.attemptVersion!,actualHandoverAt:clock.now().toISOString()});return f;}
